They are &lt;a href="https://www.laude.org/updates/moonshots-one-labs" target="_blank" rel="noopener" >one of four Laude Institute Moonshot Labs&lt;/a>, and will receive a $10 million multiyear award to start the Center for Edge Medicine.&lt;/p>
